== lines_of_a_frame
error[Z0401]: `lines` cannot be called on a Frame
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:1
  |
4 | u.lines()
  | ^ this is a Frame
  |
  = help: `lines` takes a Plot first; `x.lines(...)` is `lines(x, ...)`

== its_frame_lacks_the_group
